  "notes": [
    "The five-year gate. referenceKnowledgeInstances 277.115 -> 338.495 (+29.96 SE) and referenceNodesKnown 15.89 -> 21.58 (+44.30 SE), against referenceLivingMages -0.20 SE and referencePopulation +0.22 SE. Population is flat AT THIS HORIZON and is not flat at twenty years or under permissive-breadth; read the horizon and agency baselines before concluding the vitality wire is inert. The universe remains degenerate in the ways integration round 2 recorded, and this change closes none of them: the v1 rectangle still cannot make food, and founding a construction site is still a god action, so a run with no god actions still spends no stone. What moved is knowledge, and living mages did not move with it. Measured 2026-08-14 on w187/effects-union at 9be84ea, four workers, on a machine several agents were sharing. NO GOLDEN FIXTURE WAS REGENERATED and none needed to be. balance-gate-ascension-v1 was deliberately NOT re-recorded: it carries the same superseded contentHash and will refuse for the same reason, but its Actions job is not required to merge and a 830-1150 s sweep is a separate decision on a separate failure."
