  "rationale": "w187/effects-union unions campaign/signed-magnitudes and campaign/combined, so node effects now drive the three academic rates (research-rate, teach-rate, scribe-rate) and the two vitality primitives (lifespan, fertility). Knowledge moves numbers it could not move when these figures were recorded, and the previous baselines refuse with baseline-invalid on contentHash besides. THIS FILE IS A MEASUREMENT, NOT A BALANCE CLAIM: release-plan.md forbids a balance claim before 0.5.0, and nothing here is one. Neither parent branch could have recorded it -- combined's four negative-magnitude guard fixes were inert under a schema that said minimum 1, and signed-magnitudes' negative magnitudes were swallowed by routeYieldByForm's clamp -- so the union tree is the first tree on which these numbers exist.",
